  "bio": "Nathaniel Gann is a remarkably skilled tattoo artist specializing in Japanese styles, known for meticulously crafting each design with a high level of detail and precision. His studio in San Diego is a beacon for those seeking traditional and contemporary Japanese tattoos, where professionalism is as deeply ingrained in the experience as the ink in the skin. With a steady hand and a keen eye for the art form, Nathaniel ensures that every piece is a masterful expression of the wearer's vision.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: San Diego, California, United States\n\nColor and B&G tattoos with flow @bigtroubletattoo \nWant a tattoo? DM me or fill out my contact form.",
